  "solution": {
    "text": "The given structure has three double bonds whose each carbon atom is differently substituted hence number of geometrical isomers will be $2^{n}=2^{3^{\\prime}}=8$, where $n$ is the number of double bonds whose each carbon atom is differently substituted.",
